  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "Twelve songs to lyrics by Nikos Gatsos, sung by Manolis Mitsias and Dimitra Galani. As with Epistrofi, Hadjidakis was far away: orchestration and conducting are by Giannis Spanos. The cover is a painting by Alekos Fassianos.",
      "Here are “Chasapiko saranta”, “I mikri Rallou” and “Agapi mesa stin kardia”, which Hadjidakis would return to many times in the following decades."
